            "sid": "LUK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu ire kumae, Tek giwinjo Musa ku jubila de ngo, gibicukri ngo, kadok ng’atu moko ai ku kind ju m’utho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
